 604:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO3.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\cy_em_eeprom.c **** * For all non PSoC 6 devices the erase operation is performed by clearing
